    <briefdescription>
<para>END-specific document window subclass of <ref refid="classjam_1_1_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::Window</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classterminal_1_1_window" kindref="compound">terminal::Window</ref> extends <ref refid="classjam_1_1_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::Window</ref> with resize-tracking — a lightweight overlay that exposes whether the user is actively dragging a resize handle. This is used by <ref refid="class_main_component_1a339148bc43089300e10d5883a0a80726" kindref="member">MainComponent::resized()</ref> to suppress ruler overlays during live resize.</para>
<para>All glass, renderer, and native-context management remains in <ref refid="classjam_1_1_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::Window</ref>. Only END-specific window behaviour lives here.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classjam_1_1_window" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/doxygen/tagfile.xml">jam::Window</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="class_main_component_1a339148bc43089300e10d5883a0a80726" kindref="member">MainComponent::resized</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
